  "name": "Pullback in Uptrend Entry Composite - Stateful (v2 migration)",
  "description": "Stateful migration of pullback_uptrend_entry_composite_v2. The timing stage uses MACD divergence, which is sequence-dependent: once the last two RDP swing lows form a bullish divergence, the stateless engine can keep firing the same divergence across multiple prefix windows and double-count entries. This migration arms on the divergence event and opens a 5-bar watch window. Entry is only allowed while the strategy is in an emit-enabled phase and the full composite still passes, preserving the SPY expansion regime gate.",
  "status": "testing",
  "composition": "composite",
  "artifact_type": "indicator",
  "category": "indicator_signals",
  "pattern_id": "pullback_uptrend_entry_composite",
  "asset_class": "stocks",
  "interval": "1d",
  "universe": [],
  "structure_config": {
